.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
terraform.tfvars
*.pem
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Saved plan files are binary and can embed sensitive resource values
# (e.g. tls_private_key's private key material) even for resources marked
# "sensitive" in `terraform plan`'s human-readable output — the underlying
# .tfplan binary is not redacted the same way. Never commit these.
#
# BOTH spellings are required. An earlier version of this file listed only
# `tfplan*`, which matches `tfplan3.out` but NOT `destroy.tfplan` or
# `kuma.tfplan` — and four such files were committed to this public repo as a
# result, each embedding the 857194222592 account's RSA break-glass private
# key. See deploy/aws/terraform/DEPRECATED.md.
tfplan*
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*
